        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for Cannons-Blasted Glory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to KALE: Grakonian Campaign. A 2D arcade-style spaceship game that feels like it time-warped straight outta 1984.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras/ed546edf1f63ce88ec2d341bd6eee26f.avif?t=1786465071\" width=1024 height=1536 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KALE is a side-scrolling, neon-drenched, voice-acted sci-fi space shooter with a full-blown original story about big ugly aliens, cosmic criminals, lunar loves and one renegade pilot with a license to pew-pew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras/a4023ad31c4aaafaa2053bd2da6f262f.avif?t=1786465071\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras_big/a4023ad31c4aaafaa2053bd2da6f262f.webp?t=1786465071 width=1560 height=859 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Kale Starborn, a sarcastic and cheeky anti-hero with a mysterious past, and a ship named &quot;The Justiceblaster&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission? Save Moon22F from the evil mega-corporation of the Grakonians—who are totally not a parody of every 80s villain conglomerate ever. Pinky promise ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras/eb3b8ea4971d6d10fda414009d22da67.avif?t=1786465071\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras_big/eb3b8ea4971d6d10fda414009d22da67.webp?t=1786465071 width=1560 height=856 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥Voice acting that's so passionate, you’ll swear it’s a radio drama in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥A full original story written like your favorite B-movie sci-fi flick—campy, dramatic, and surprisingly emotional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras/e2a4d6636f55ba98b854109328cb7bfa.avif?t=1786465071\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras_big/e2a4d6636f55ba98b854109328cb7bfa.webp?t=1786465071 width=1560 height=857 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥Orchestral, Country and Synthwave soundtrack that makes your heart race and your mustache grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥Hand-crafted concept art that glows with radioactive charm and laser beam love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras/95715689eeea8f3e0c9b9fdc5694d57b.avif?t=1786465071\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras_big/95715689eeea8f3e0c9b9fdc5694d57b.webp?t=1786465071 width=1560 height=854 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras/b5b2b0c399c6288281166acb970369c3.avif?t=1786465071\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras_big/b5b2b0c399c6288281166acb970369c3.webp?t=1786465071 width=1560 height=857 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future won’t save itself... but you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras/b87e0cf6a9df914f56c2fb028c03c2a9.avif?t=1786465071\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras_big/b87e0cf6a9df914f56c2fb028c03c2a9.webp?t=1786465071 width=1560 height=854 /></span></p>",
